<title>PHILIPPINES: PLDT shares hit year-high in Manila.</title>
<headline>PLDT shares hit year-high in Manila.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co (PLDT) shares gained 45 pesos, or 2.68 percent, to a year high of 1,720 pesos in early Manila trade on Thursday on talk of a major rise in call volume in the first eight months of the year, brokers said.</p>
</text>
